@startuml
' !theme crayon

title Decentralized and Distributed Systems

rectangle "Centralized System" as centralized
rectangle "Decentralized System" as decentralized
rectangle "Distributed System" as distributed

note top of centralized : "Single Point of Failure,\nCentralized Control"

rectangle "Network of Nodes" as nodes
nodes -- distributed : Supports
distributed -- decentralized : Enables

note right of decentralized : "Enhanced Fault Tolerance,\nIncreased Resilience"
note right of distributed : "Scalability & Redundancy"

centralized -- distributed : Traditional Architecture
distributed -- decentralized : Evolution

actor User

User -- decentralized : Interacts With

@enduml